# The enchanted land's controller, not the Aura's controller, takes the damage.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Psychic Venom
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Psychic Venom.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Psychic Venom.AttachedTo = Island
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 18
